LOG falcon-max-run-streaming-qa

# Owner reproduction: F1/slot 0 starts Falcon on the flat ceiling route in
# World 1-2.  A quick Right release/repress enters Dash, then Run while the
# button remains held.  The screenshots and RAM snapshots span multiple
# eight-frame area-parser service cycles.
WAIT 3
HOLD RIGHT
WAIT 1
RELEASE RIGHT
WAIT 1
HOLD RIGHT

WAIT 32
DUMP_RAM 06D0 B0
ASSERT_RAM8 06FF 04 max-run scroll delta stays at parser capacity
ASSERT_RAM8 0700 40 max-run native speed stays at parser capacity
ASSERT_RAM8 071A 00 first camera page
ASSERT_RAM8 0725 01 parser remains ahead of camera
ASSERT_RAM8 073D 06 parser debt remains below one column set
SCREENSHOT C:/temp/falcon_max_run_stream_32.png
